<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.6325 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.6325 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6325 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange on Tuesday from 4.6310 at the last trading session on August 30.</p>
<p>				     Sept 17		 Aug 30</p>
<p> Lei per dollar		  4.6325		  4.6310</p>
<p> Volume traded ($)	     5,000		   50,000</p>
<p>				     Sept 17		 Sept 16</p>
<p> Lei per 1,000 roubles	 0.8570		  0.8577</p>
<p> Volume traded (R million)   150		     200</p>
<p>--Moscow newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
